From: SBE1V1K build <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] nss-ecm: register the front-end sysctl table with an explicit entry count on 6.11+

ecm_front_end_sysctl_tbl is the only ECM table built into ecm.ko that
carries a trailing "{}" terminator.  On 6.11+ register_sysctl() counts
it, sysctl_check_table() rejects the NULL-procname entry, and
registration returns NULL:

  sysctl table check failed: net/ecm/(null) procname is null
  sysctl table check failed: net/ecm/(null) No proc_handler

with the result that the front-end sysctl tree (front_end_conn_limit,
ppe_fse_enable, udp/tcp_denied_ports, unidir_accel_en, sixth_tuple_mode,
...) is missing from /proc/sys/net/ecm, and the
ECM_FRONT_END_SFE_ENABLE guard skips ecm_sfe_sysctl_tbl_init().  Seen on
2026-11-19 during a live "nss-load load full" on 25.12.

Use register_sysctl_sz() with ARRAY_SIZE(table) - 1 on kernel 6.11+.
linux/version.h is already included by this file.

Signed-off-by: SBE1V1K build <noreply@example.invalid>
---
diff -ruN a/frontends/ecm_front_end_common.c b/frontends/ecm_front_end_common.c
--- a/frontends/ecm_front_end_common.c	2026-11-19 01:08:34.755803464 +0000
+++ b/frontends/ecm_front_end_common.c	2026-11-19 01:08:48.284454746 +0000
@@ -1753,7 +1753,15 @@
 	/*
 	 * Register sysctl table.
 	 */
+#if LINUX_VERSION_CODE >= KERNEL_VERSION(6, 11, 0)
+	/* 6.11 起 register_sysctl() 取 ARRAY_SIZE(table) 作为条目数，把表尾的
+	 * "{}" 哨兵也算进去；哨兵 procname 为 NULL、无 proc_handler，校验失败
+	 * 导致注册返回 NULL。显式传真实条目数。 */
+	ecm_front_end_ctl_tbl_hdr = register_sysctl_sz("net/ecm", ecm_front_end_sysctl_tbl,
+			ARRAY_SIZE(ecm_front_end_sysctl_tbl) - 1);
+#else
 	ecm_front_end_ctl_tbl_hdr = register_sysctl("net/ecm", ecm_front_end_sysctl_tbl);
+#endif
 #ifdef ECM_FRONT_END_SFE_ENABLE
 	if (ecm_front_end_ctl_tbl_hdr) {
 		ecm_sfe_sysctl_tbl_init();
